unset; justify-content: unset; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1634691679187" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1634691679187"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h3>PRODUCT DESIGN</h3></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1634691709563" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1634691709563"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p>デザイン・機能・価格のバランスの取れたものづくりを心がけ、お客様に長く使っていただける服に仕上げています。</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1634684624968" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1634684624968" data-resolution="3000x3000" data-atomgroup="module"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs"><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/ab413adb-903f-46ef-b7db-9565c49d21bb/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/image%20125.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" natural-width="1920" natural-height="1272" data-width="100%" data-height="auto"></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" class="gf_row gf_equal-height" id="r-1634684625009" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1634684625009" data-layout-lg="6+6" data-extraclass="" data-layout-md="6+6" data-layout-sm="6+6" data-layout-xs="12+12" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; visibility: visible;"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1634683852833" data-id="1634683852833" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; min-height: auto;"><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1634684625056" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1634684625056" data-extraclass="" style="display: block; flex-wrap: unset; visibility: visible; min-height: auto;"><div 